For 2013, the Basic Hot Wheels lineup has been completely revamped. 
There are now only 5 main Series: 50 HW City cars, 25 HW Imagination Cars, 25 HW Stunt cars, 50 HW Racing Cars, and 100 HW Showroom cars, for a total of 250 cars for the year.

There is no longer a specific segment for [[2013 New Models|New Models]], new castings are interspersed throughout the mainline.

==[[HW City Series|HW City]]==
Experience life in the fast lane with these high-speed street vehicles. Whether they're racing downtown, speeding on the highways or cruising the city, they're always ready for action. Collect them all to build a city scene with no speed limit!
